Apple today added several new games to <a href="https://www.apple.com/apple-arcade/">Apple Arcade</a>, including Crossy Road Rush, NBA 2K27 Arcade Edition, Kami 2+, and Food Stylist - Design Game+.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/crossy-road-rush.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1075995" /><br/>
Crossy Road Rush is the latest game in the popular Crossy Road series. Players will make their way across an island obstacle course and unlock fun characters. The game supports up to four players in local or online multiplayer, as well as solo play.<br/>
<br/>
NBA 2K27 adds the WNBA, which is a first for the Arcade Edition. The game has all 15 WNBA teams and 180 active players, though they're limited to Quick Match and Blacktop modes. The new edition also has faster, deeper progression for the MyCAREER journey and a refreshed Neighborhood. <br/>
<br/>
Kami 2+ is a puzzle game where players fold colorful paper patterns, and Food Stylist lets players create virtual dishes and tablescapes inspired by cuisines around the world. <br/>
